openvpn (2.7.7-debian0) stable; urgency=medium

  * OpenVPN Release 2.7.7 (Gert Doering, 85f07f7b)
  * Ignore acks for packets that cannot be outstanding (Arne Schwabe, b439b303)
  * Avoid unbounded reliable TLS timeout (Arne Schwabe, a9b75ba3)
  * Move check_session_buf_not_used method into the method that free the buffer (Arne Schwabe, c52f9401)
  * win32: unit-test the CreateProcess() command line quoting (Lev Stipakov, eb2469f7)
  * win32: quote arguments that cmd.exe would reinterpret (Lev Stipakov, 26653e7d)
  * tapctl: prevent binary planting with netsh (Heiko Hund, 19b1b9f8)
  * win: don't use NULL DACL with system objects (Heiko Hund, 73fb222a)
  * networking_sitnl: validate netlink replies against the request (Antonio Quartulli, fbcf3c44)
  * openvpnserv: fix off-by-one input validation (Heiko Hund, 99f46d12)
  * openvpnserv: pass correct NRPT domains size (Heiko Hund, 203e275f)
  * openvpnserv: harden CheckConfigPath() a bit more (Heiko Hund, f6621b13)
  * openvpnserv: don't allow '/' in config paths (Heiko Hund, fde48924)
  * dhcp: Fix off-by-one in write_dhcp_search_str() temp buffer guard (Nexory, cc2032f3)
  * mbedtls: Work-around bug in mbedtls 4.1.0 and 4.2.0 (Frank Lichtenheld, 2c825c24)
  * multi: don't let stale-routes-check delete permanent routes (Antonio Quartulli, a2070e0b)
  * openvpnserv: fix log lines format string (Heiko Hund, 840db527)
  * doc: Update doxygen references to removed tunnel_server_{udp, tcp}() (Razvan Cojocaru, ec2b4007)
  * clinat: do not adjust UDP checksum if zero (Antonio Quartulli, e1d0005e)
  * .clang-format: Convert deprecated setting KeepEmptyLinesAtTheStartOfBlocks (Frank Lichtenheld, fd89ec74)
  * Reduce number of future epoch keys from 16 to 4 (Arne Schwabe, f7196ed4)
  * t_client.sh.in: Do not try to guess the absolute path to LOGDIR (Frank Lichtenheld, 5d81653b)
  * win32-util.h: Fix includes (Frank Lichtenheld, 6223c4bb)
  * OpenSSL: avoid resetting the HMAC key on every packet (Gleb Pesin, e04e93a3)
  * Fix format string specifier for size_t (Max Fillinger, 4c32d339)
  * ssl: Do not queue control ciphertext while a packet is still queued (Frank Lichtenheld, 1a687fde)
  * t_client.sh.in: Use printf instead of echo -e (Frank Lichtenheld, 2c0c5809)
  * Reenable xmit_hold when using p2p tcp-server and tls-server (Arne Schwabe, c26995bf)
  * t_client.rc-sample: Add missing documentation for FPING_ARGS_x (Frank Lichtenheld, 1728a757)
  * Make test_misc compile with -Werror again. (Arne Schwabe, 6f6d02e7)
  * Remove local get_random in test_misc.c (Arne Schwabe, 3402f9aa)

